{"id":"stockholm-boat-80x-nybroplan","group":"stockholm-boat-80x","city":"Stockholm","mode":"boat","line":"80X","vehicle":"båt","vehicleLong":"båt","operator":"SL","api":"sl","tab":"","guide":null,"speedKmh":20,"dwellSec":60,"route":[[59.318333,18.158909],[59.318764,18.157151],[59.318014,18.11324],[59.318596,18.096981],[59.327332,18.088382],[59.33206,18.076519]],"stops":[{"name":"Nacka strand","lat":59.318333,"lon":18.158909,"story":"Välkommen ombord på båt 80X mot Nybroplan! Resan tar ungefär 19 minuter. Nacka strand hette länge Augustendal. 1899 köpte industripionjären J.V. Svensson området och skapade 500 jobb i verkstadsindustrin. Under en lågkonjunktur på 1920-talet gick han i konkurs. På 1980-talet byggdes kontor och bostäder, och 1988 fick området namnet Nacka strand. Vid årsskiftet 2024–2025 öppnade kocken Pontus Frithiof restaurangen Fabriken här.","tips":[],"dur":33.8,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Ms_Ballerina_outside_Nacka_strand_September_2010.jpg/1280px-Ms_Ballerina_outside_Nacka_strand_September_2010.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Ankara","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ms_Ballerina_outside_Nacka_strand_September_2010.jpg","title":"M/s Ballerina outside Nacka strand.","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/PolisbatNackaStrand.JPG/1280px-PolisbatNackaStrand.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Patrik Nylin","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PolisbatNackaStrand.JPG","title":"Polisbåt av typen Stridsbåt 90H vid Nacka Strand","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/GurliNackaStrand20140403.jpg/1280px-GurliNackaStrand20140403.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Patrik Nylin","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:GurliNackaStrand20140403.jpg","title":"m/s Gurli utanför Nacka Strand, Stockholm 3 april 2014. Byggd 1871 vid Bergsunds Mek Verkstad som Ny","near":true}],"audio":"audio/piper/cd21340660ace905.mp3"},{"name":"Nybroplan","lat":59.33206,"lon":18.076519,"story":"Snart är vi framme vid ändhållplatsen Nybroplan. Vid Nybroplan ligger Dramaten, Kungliga Dramatiska teatern, invigd 1908. Härifrån börjar Strandvägen, med sina pampiga sekelskifteshus längs vattnet, och från Nybrokajen går båtar ut i skärgården. Tack för att du åkte med!","tips":[["Strandvägen, promenad längs vattnet","2 min"],["Båtar från Nybrokajen","2 min"]],"dur":16.0,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Norrmalm%2C_Stockholm%2C_Sweden_-_panoramio_%2841%29.jpg/1280px-Norrmalm%2C_Stockholm%2C_Sweden_-_panoramio_%2841%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Алексей Решетников","license":"CC BY 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Norrmalm,_Stockholm,_Sweden_-_panoramio_(41).jpg","title":"Norrmalm, Stockholm, Sweden","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Sweden_-_Stockholm_-_panoramio_%2823%29.jpg/1280px-Sweden_-_Stockholm_-_panoramio_%2823%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"randreu","license":"CC BY 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sweden_-_Stockholm_-_panoramio_(23).jpg","title":"Sweden - Stockholm","near":true},{"src":"https://pub.raa.se/dokumentation/40c8b182-f89b-41d4-9376-5386108120ab/visning/1","credit":"Claesson, Erik","license":"Public domain","page":"https://kulturarvsdata.se/raa/dokumentation/html/40c8b182-f89b-41d4-9376-5386108120ab","title":"Nybroplan/Birgerjarlsgatan, Stockholm City","old":true,"year":1966,"museum":"Riksantikvarieämbetet"},{"src":"https://pub.raa.se/dokumentation/ea4ba032-18b9-48b6-8228-6d2c117fa83a/visning/1","credit":"Claesson, Erik","license":"Public domain","page":"https://kulturarvsdata.se/raa/dokumentation/html/ea4ba032-18b9-48b6-8228-6d2c117fa83a","title":"Nybroplan mot Hötorgscity - City","old":true,"year":1967,"museum":"Riksantikvarieämbetet"}],"audio":"audio/piper/2c0e3f0c4594fcf8.mp3"}],"looks":[{"id":"vasamuseet","lat":59.328,"lon":18.0914,"r":220,"text":"Till höger ser du Vasamuseets tak, med masterna som visar hur högt skeppet Vasa är.","dur":6.0,"audio":"audio/piper/eaaa4ef09e4e6ca3.mp3"},{"id":"gronalund","lat":59.3233,"lon":18.0966,"r":260,"text":"Till höger ligger Gröna Lund, Sveriges äldsta nöjespark.","dur":4.6,"audio":"audio/piper/c304d39026fb2ed9.mp3"}],"from":"Nacka strand","to":"Nybroplan","variant":"Mot Nybroplan","color":["#0089ca","#ffffff"],"trips":54,"source":"SL via Trafiklab (GTFS Regional)","tts":"Piper"}